{"feeds": {"type": "feed", "id": "187347118949140480", "url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "title": "字节跳动技术团队", "description": "字节跳动的技术实践分享\n(wechat feed made by @ttttmr https://wechat2rss.xlab.app)", "siteUrl": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "image": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM4Mz0zV5VtfHx3vA6LLNw3npTWibbGbYhtsc131DoN6m0A/0", "errorMessage": null, "errorAt": null, "ownerUserId": null}, "entries": {"feedId": "187347118949140480", "id": "251279868125227008", "title": "3D数字分身的奇幻舞台：火山引擎空间视频技术解密", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247518571&idx=1&sn=5f1ad978e5273998c7df19257047a93d", "content": "<p>原创 <span>视频与边缘</span> <span>2026-03-02 17:03</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=4f9a8fd5&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9Fef3RBaWyzP9ZZdje9lnEkLnzhgibzQPTh4H08Mc6Ts06W9AljSOuTgyVF5MSDsEibR5wZBWQwSUmOnEic8lruvKulXEic3ibnEPBLyU%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  \n  <div style=\"font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>2026年总台马年春晚，一首歌舞节目中，舞台上“凭空”出现了数位与主演分毫不差的自己——她们立于不同方位，动作各异，光影随行，镜头游走时，侧脸的轮廓、肩线的转折，乃至投在地板上的影子，都与真人同步变幻。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>这不是绿幕抠像，不是预置素材，而是由火山引擎空间视频技术实时驱动的“3D数字克隆”现场！</span></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>虚实无界：当数字分身拥有“物理灵魂”</span></strong></p></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>与传统的“复制粘贴”式虚拟形象不同，此次春晚呈现的数字分身具备两个颠覆性特征：</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>一、透视随镜，立体在场。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>当导播切换机位、推拉摇移，屏幕上的分身视角同步发生符合物理规则的透视变化——镜头扫过侧面，你能清晰看到颧骨的起伏、耳廓的阴影；镜头拉远，分身的空间占位与真实演员分毫不差，是真正拥有三维坐标的数字个体。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>二、光影共生，实时响应。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>舞台追光灯由暖转冷，分身身上的高光与暗部同步迁移；灯光变暗，分身脚下的影子随之虚化。虚实之间的光感一致性，达到了肉眼难以分辨的程度。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>观众的真实反馈是：“舞台上好像站着好几对双胞胎。”</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a87af47c&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FFGB4hYw9FedUPDWL9eqaZyMAWU7Od3v2dlHuwhsVR05PYE5mMSeqwUIiaKMRe657JK5ibEoXc6UgYbCc1PQmEEsfiaVygEC9NGYYU7c3GrSxBw%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div><div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>《梦底》</span></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>技术破局：从采集到渲染的全链路实时化</span></strong></p></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>如此“活”的数字分身，其技术底座是火山引擎空间视频解决方案，一条从4D资产生成到实时舞台集成的完整管道。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>1. 四维重建：70台相机“冻结”时间与空间</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>演员在专业环绕式采集棚中完成表演。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>70台工业级高分辨率相机呈球面分布，以极高帧率同步捕捉每一瞬间的多视角画面。这套系统不只记录动作，更记录光在皮肤、衣物上的反射特性，为后续光影真实渲染埋下伏笔。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>海量多视角视频流被上传至云端，经火山引擎自研4D高斯泼溅（4DGS）重建算法处理，输出为高保真4D数字资产——这是一段“可被实时渲染、可被任意视角观看”的动态三维表演。</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>2. 实时渲染引擎：与导播、灯光“对话”</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>重建完成的4D资产被导入Unreal Engine / Unity等主流游戏引擎。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>但真正的挑战在于：如何让虚拟世界实时响应真实舞台的变化？</span></p></div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>与导播系统联动：虚拟摄像机实时接收导播台机位参数，实现渲染视角与播出视角的毫秒级对齐。</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>与灯光系统联动：舞台灯光控制采用DMX512协议，火山团队搭建实时转译层，将每一路DMX信号映射为虚拟引擎中的光源参数——颜色、强度、位置、光束角。物理灯光一变，虚拟灯光即变，延迟低于人眼感知阈值。</span></p></li></ul><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>豆包大模型加持：破解“多人+近景”两大性能困局</span></strong></p></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>当数字分身从单一个体扩展为“十余个同台”，从远景调度逼近“面部特写”，传统渲染架构面临算力与逼真度的双重瓶颈。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>本次春晚，火山引擎空间视频团队首次引入豆包大模型能力，针对性攻克两大核心难题。</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>优化一：影子几何——为十人同台“减负”</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>在戏曲节目等高密度场景中，十余个高精度数字人同台表演。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>若每一人都实时计算完整光影与阴影投射，单台渲染服务器的算力将被迅速耗尽。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>解决方案：豆包3D模型为演员每一帧预生成一个极简几何外壳——该外壳不可见，仅用于阴影计算。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>渲染时，系统只需计算这个简化Mesh的投影，而非高精度模型的全部几何细节。阴影质量几乎无损，计算量降低70%以上，多人同台实时渲染成为可能。</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>优化二：法线先验——让近景特写“不跳帧”</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>舞蹈节目的近景镜头中，演员面部占据大半个屏幕。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>传统光影重建算法在特写下容易产生法线方向抖动，导致光影“跳变”，破坏真实感。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>解决方案：引入豆包DA3（Depth Anything v3）模型，从单帧画面中极稳定地推断深度信息。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>基于深度计算法线，再以此作为先验约束参与光照求解——先有几何确信度，再算光影变化。这一机制彻底消除了近景下的光影闪烁，使皮肤质感的细腻过渡得以完美呈现。</span></p></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>从早期的动作捕捉，到当下的4D实时重建；从依赖预渲染，到与导播、灯光系统实时对话；从单一个体，到多人同台、近景特写——火山引擎空间视频技术正在将“数字分身”从实验场景推入国家级舞台的核心创作语汇。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>2026年春晚只是一个开始。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>当技术足够隐形，艺术便获得自由。</span></p></div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></div><p style=\"display: none;\"></p>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/share/base/form/shrcnoy1jLCZYmbZE4gm6kaWCvg?from=navigation\" target=\"_blank\">阅读原文</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/link-proxy/?k=a9f774cb&#x26;r=1&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%3F__biz%3DMzI1MzYzMjE0MQ%3D%3D%26mid%3D2247518571%26idx%3D1%26sn%3D5f1ad978e5273998c7df19257047a93d\" target=\"_blank\">跳转微信打开</a></p>", "description": "原创 视频与边缘 2026-03-02 17:03 北京 2026年总台马年春晚，一首歌舞节目中，舞台上“凭空”出现了数位与主演分毫不差的自己——她们立于不同方位，动作各异，光影随行，镜头游走时，侧脸的轮廓、肩线的转折，乃至投在地板上的影子，都与真人同步变幻。\n\n这不是绿幕抠像，不是预置素材，而是由火山引擎空间视频技术实时驱动的“3D数字克隆”现场！\n\n虚实无界：当数字分身拥有“物理灵魂”\n\n与传统的“复制粘贴”式虚拟形象不同，此次春晚呈现的数字分身具备两个颠覆性特征：\n\n一、透视随镜，立体在场。\n\n当导播切换机位、推拉摇移…", "guid": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247518571&idx=1&sn=5f1ad978e5273998c7df19257047a93d", "author": null, "authorUrl": null, "authorAvatar": null, "insertedAt": "2026-03-02T12:59:42.618Z", "publishedAt": "2026-03-02T09:03:00.152Z", "media": [{"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=4f9a8fd5&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9Fef3RBaWyzP9ZZdje9lnEkLnzhgibzQPTh4H08Mc6Ts06W9AljSOuTgyVF5MSDsEibR5wZBWQwSUmOnEic8lruvKulXEic3ibnEPBLyU%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg", "type": "photo", "width": 1280, "height": 544}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a87af47c&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FFGB4hYw9FedUPDWL9eqaZyMAWU7Od3v2dlHuwhsVR05PYE5mMSeqwUIiaKMRe657JK5ibEoXc6UgYbCc1PQmEEsfiaVygEC9NGYYU7c3GrSxBw%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}], "categories": null, "attachments": null, "extra": {}, "language": null, "summary": "The 2026 Spring Festival Gala featured real‑time 3D digital clones of performers that matched motion, lighting and shadows exactly. Created with Volcano Engine’s space‑video pipeline, the process used 70 cameras to produce 4D assets captured by a 4D Gaussian splatting algorithm. The assets were rendered in Unreal/Unity, syncing virtual cameras with live broadcast feeds and live DMX lighting via a real‑time translation layer. To handle many close‑up clones, optimized shadow geometry and depth‑based normal cues from the “豆包” model ensured high performance and photorealism."}, "settings": {}}